; l4n_hlae_plugin version: v0.2
[HLAE]
; Root of the packaged HLAE runtime resources.
; Relative paths are resolved from the folder containing this INI file.
; The plugin is installed at bin/neko/plugins and the core at the game root.
; Three parent folders reach the game root from the plugin directory.
HlaeRoot=..\..\..\l4n_hlae_core
